  id: climb
  title: 6. Wrong Car, Right Mountain
  region: Juniper Switchbacks
  briefing: Drive the tiny Thimble through four mountain checkpoints before the financing
    beacon expires. Your selected compatible upgrades carry over.
  opening: 'Ellis: The narrow gate only admits the hatchback. Mara: Of course the
    road to the radio tower was designed by someone with a golf cart.'
  midpoint: 'Bea: Second gear, steady throttle. You do not need boost here. Please
    record that I said this voluntarily.'
  closing: 'Ellis: We reached the tower. The hatchback has earned a mountain certification.
    The paperwork is a dent shaped like a rock.'
  optionalObjective: Finish in under 160 seconds
